Any use of the software that is not Commercial Use is noncommercial use.

## Commercial Use

Commercial Use is each of the following:

(a) using the software to provide a service, input, or output to anyone on a commercial basis

(b) using the software for an internal business purpose

(c) using the software to generate income or other commercial advantage

(d) distributing the software for a fee or other commercial compensation

(e) distributing the software under an agreement with terms that are different from the terms of this license

